      "Discussion, paragraph 24"
     ],
     "finding": "The source measures pure, Al-free, rutile-type SiO2 stishovite and fits all P-V-T data jointly to an MGD model with either Vinet or BM3 as the 300 K reference isotherm. The presentation-leading Vinet solution is represented exactly; V0 and a are fixed and the remaining five coefficients are fitted.",
     "doi": "10.1029/2011JB009100"
    },
    "primary_data_check": {
