      "Publisher-listed tab-delimited supplement jgrb17202-sup-0001-t01.txt"
     ],
     "finding": "All 56 Table 1 observations are bundled with data identifiers, temperature, pressure, tetragonal lattice parameters, conventional-cell volume, simultaneous Au volume, and every printed parenthetical e.s.d. The publisher's supplement endpoint was unavailable to this audit client, so the transcription was verified against the complete official HTML rendering of Table 1."
    }
